BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

Given the sets:
- [`E = \{x | x > 5\}`]
- [`F = \{x | x \leq 13\}`]
- [`G = \{3, 7\}`]

Compute:
- [`E \cup F = `] [_____]{$set_ans_1}
- [`(G) \cup ((G \cap ((E \cup E)))) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_2}

---

Given the sets:
- [`E = \{x | x \geq 6\}`]
- [`F = \{x | 4 < x < 10\}`]
- [`G = \{6, 9, 11, 15, 17\}`]

Compute:
- [`F \cup E = `] [_____]{$set_ans_3}
- [`(E \cup G) \cup G \cup F = `] [_____]{$set_ans_4}

---

Given the sets:
- [`E = \{1, 2, 12, 15, 17\}`]
- [`F = \{3, 7, 8, 13, 15\}`]

Compute:
- [`F \cup F \cup (E) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_5}
- [`E \cup F \cup E \cap ((F) \cup (F) \cap F) \cup E \cup E = `] [_____]{$set_ans_6}
- [`(E) \cup (F \cap F) \cup F \cap F \cup F \cup F = `] [_____]{$set_ans_7}

---

Given the sets:
- [`E = \{x | x \geq 6\}`]
- [`F = \{4, 7, 10, 11, 18, 19\}`]
- [`G = \{6, 10, 13, 14, 15\}`]

Compute:
- [`E \cup (E \cap F) \cup E = `] [_____]{$set_ans_8}
- [`F \cup E \cup G = `] [_____]{$set_ans_9}
- [`F \cap E \cap F = `] [_____]{$set_ans_10}

---

Given the sets:
- [`E = \{2, 15\}`]
- [`F = \{x | x \geq 3\}`]

Compute:
- [`F \cup (E) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_11}
- [`F \cup F \cup F \cup F = `] [_____]{$set_ans_12}

---

Given the sets:
- [`E = \{x | x > 6\}`]
- [`F = \{0, 7, 8, 12, 15, 19\}`]
- [`G = \{x | x < 11\}`]

Compute:
- [`F \cup ((E)) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_13}
- [`G \cup (G \cup (G \cup (G))) \cup (E \cup E) \cup (E) = `] [_____]{$set_ans_14}

---
END_PGML
